      "log": [
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 5.7,
          "text": "Neri Bell died before the stove could be lit. Mara, Tomas and Inez must bring warmth to the lime kiln refuge. Silas Orr has not returned."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 5.736336200000044,
          "text": "Tomas led Mara toward Copperglass for heat, food and Copper. Silas Orr remains missing."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 5.827835800000138,
          "text": "Mara found a deliberately severed signal wire."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 5.946163800000244,
          "text": "Inez reached the animal pen and recognized Copper\u2019s saddle under a company eviction tag."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 5.946163800000244,
          "text": "Voss recognized Tomas\u2019s community token during the approach. The guards raised their rifles after his order to seize Tomas."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.009576300000294,
          "text": "Tomas and Inez held the boiler yard. Mara can search the relay room while Voss flees."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.041320200000294,
          "text": "Ansel Voss escaped through the service tunnel. He will recognize Mara at a later freight checkpoint."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.099148400000335,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s wool blankets."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.120150600000361,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s lamp oil."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.140481200000385,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s dry kindling."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.157649800000408,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s oat sack."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.177817400000424,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s clean bandages."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.197483400000433,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s canned broth."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.297316800000466,
          "text": "Pavel Dune ambushed Mara in the coal store. Her revolver and community token fell to the floor."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.351816200000491,
          "text": "Mara chose to kill Pavel. His pressure-fuse warning and Silas\u2019s ice-viaduct route were recorded regardless of his fate."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.454982800000502,
          "text": "Inez\u2019s old rope halter identifies Copper as the community\u2019s seized pack mare."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.59131320000055,
          "text": "Inez assigned Copper to Mara for community supply work. Riding, feeding and pack storage will unlock when the mare returns safely to the kiln."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.637978200000556,
          "text": "Mara promised Ada to preserve the message log before moving Gideon."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.646807800000558,
          "text": "Mara opened the west pressure relief valve before moving the Rusks."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.712640600000572,
          "text": "The Copperglass message log schedules Silas Orr\u2019s interception at the ice viaduct. This record may support a later railroad hearing."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 6.712640600000572,
          "text": "Mara collected the station\u2019s message log."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 7.012024533333974,
          "text": "A station bandage treated Gideon after the longer rescue for the message log."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 7.012024533333974,
          "text": "Ada isolated the relay circuit. The boiler wing collapsed; the relay remains damaged but usable. Both Rusks survived."
        },
        {
          "day": 1,
          "time": 7.275964600000673,
          "text": "The recovered broth and kindling warmed the kiln. Ada joined the community; Gideon needs care. Neri\u2019s empty place was remembered. Silas Orr\u2019s rescue is the next obligation."
        }
      ],
